    <string name="muac_age_scope_warning">Standard MUAC colour bands are for children 6–59 months—seek clinical advice outside this age range.</string>
    <string name="muac_reference_ranges_body">• Red — under 11.5 cm: Severe Acute Malnutrition (SAM)\n• Yellow — 11.5 cm up to below 12.5 cm: Moderate Acute Malnutrition (MAM)\n• Green — 12.5 cm and above: normal on typical MUAC tapes for 6–59 months</string>
